  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều bên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Dựng hình bình hành <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nhận thấy khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>L</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/0fad7ef3e2eb599535eb0dc56195f152ccaf876ff4411475070bfd0def34b525.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\n\t\tLại có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>15</mn></msqrt><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
